index 7d7883f..cdb8aad 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1 +1,26 @@
 # shorty — a small URL shortener service
+
+A URL shortener built on the JDK only (`com.sun.net.httpserver`, hand-written JSON).
+Links are kept in a JSON data file that is rewritten atomically on every change.
+
+## Build, test, run
+
+```
+./build.sh                      # -> build/shorty.jar (Java 21)
+./test.sh                       # builds, then runs src/test/java/shorty/AllTests
+java -jar build/shorty.jar --port 8080 --data links.json [--base-url URL] [--rate-limit N]
+```
+
+## API
+
+| request | result |
+|---|---|
+| `POST /api/links` `{"url", "code"?, "ttl_seconds"?}` | `201` link (`200` for an existing identical link) |
+| `GET /<code>` | `302` to the target, counts a hit (`410` once expired) |
+| `GET /api/links?limit=&offset=` | `{"total", "links"}` |
+| `GET /api/links/<code>` / `DELETE /api/links/<code>` | link / `204` |
+| `GET /api/stats` | `{"total_links", "total_hits", "top"}` |
+| `GET /healthz` | `{"status": "ok"}` |
+
+Errors are `{"error": "..."}`. Link creation is rate-limited per client IP
+(`--rate-limit` requests per sliding minute, default 30).
